		{
			dependencies: ["7E496F23593AA01F"]
			description: ["&eCylinders put the refinery's fuels to work in a diesel engine. Each contains the space where burning fuel expands against a piston; lubrication oil helps the piston travel repeatedly along its bore.&r"]
			disable_toast: true
