			dependencies: ["3FD32B9970D4E3D9"]
			description: ["&ePolymerization links propylene molecules into long polypropylene chains. While molten, the polymer can take the shape of a mold; cooling gives it the solid form used as material stock and sheets.&r"]
			disable_toast: true
