			title: "Polypropylene"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E496F23593AA01F"]
			description: [
				"&eLubricant keeps moving surfaces apart with an oil film, reducing direct contact and friction. The heavy machine core accepts specialized lubrication oil as an alternative to plant oil.&r"
				""
				"&eThe specialized stock needs a smaller fluid charge for the same assembly. This is an advantage in manufacture, rather than a change to the finished core's function.&r"
			]
			icon: "kubejs:incomplete_heavy_machine"
